# Everything is out, and only what the image needs is let in. A new top-level folder stays
# out of the image until it is named here.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!shared/
!sync/
!bin/money

# A node_modules inside a workspace is the machine's, never the image's.
**/node_modules

# Tests and their helpers are not part of what runs.
**/*.test.ts
**/testing/
